---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Contact Us • Editorial Desk & Enterprise Partnerships" 
  description="Get in touch with the HeliaTech Media team for software review requests, editorial inquiries, advertising opportunities, and corporate partnerships."
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 sm:px-8 py-16">
    <!-- Header Badge -->
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-slate-900 border border-cyan-500/30 text-cyan-300 text-xs font-mono mb-8 shadow-glow-cyan">
      <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-cyan-400"></span>
      <span>COMMUNICATIONS DESK • RESPONSE TIME < 24H</span>
    </div>

    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-white tracking-tight leading-tight mb-6">
      Connect With the <br />
      <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-400 via-sky-300 to-fuchsia-400">
        HeliaTech Editorial & Partnerships Team
      </span>
    </h1>

    <p class="text-slate-400 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-12">
      Whether you are an enterprise software vendor seeking an independent technical audit, an advertiser looking for high-intent B2B sponsorships, or a reader with feedback, we would love to hear from you.
    </p>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-16">
      
      <!-- Card 1: Partnerships -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-cyan-500/30 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="text-2xl mb-4">🤝</div>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">Partnerships & Sponsoring</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs leading-relaxed mb-6">
            For newsletter sponsorships (*The Thursday Radar*), custom benchmark dossier co-marketing, and brand partner inclusions.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-500 block mb-1">Direct Partner Channel:</span>
          <a 
            href="mailto:partnership@heliatech.online" 
            class="inline-block px-4 py-2 rounded-xl bg-cyan-500/15 hover:bg-cyan-500/25 border border-cyan-500/30 text-cyan-300 font-mono text-xs font-bold transition-all"
          >
            partnership@heliatech.online
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2: Editorial & Research -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="text-2xl mb-4">🔬</div>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">Editorial Desk & Audits</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Submit software tools for architectural review, notify us of pricing leaks or rate-card updates, or request corrections.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-500 block mb-1">Editorial Inquiry Channel:</span>
          <a 
            href="mailto:partnership@heliatech.online" 
            class="inline-block px-4 py-2 rounded-xl bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 border border-slate-700 text-slate-200 font-mono text-xs font-bold transition-all"
          >
            editor@heliatech.online
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Direct Contact Notice & Protocol -->
    <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 space-y-6">
      <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2">
        <span>⚡</span> Direct Inbound Message Protocol
      </h3>
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs leading-relaxed">
        Our editorial and partnerships desks operate on a strict <strong>24-hour response SLA</strong> on business days. When reaching out regarding software benchmarks or pricing leaks, please include:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5 text-slate-400 font-mono text-xs">
        <li>Official product name and website URL.</li>
        <li>Relevant documentation, API changelog, or rate card links.</li>
        <li>Contact details and official corporate domain email of the submitter.</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="pt-4 border-t border-slate-800/80 text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-500">
        <span>Official Domain: <strong>heliatech.online</strong> • Verified SSL / SHA-256 Air-Gapped Compliance</span>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</Layout>
